<Layout title="Privacy" description="How this small static site handles visitor data and external services."><article class="article"><p class="eyebrow">Last updated October 5, 2026</p><h1>A small site.<br />A short privacy note.</h1><p>This version of Jacob Builds has no accounts, purchase checkout, signup forms, advertising scripts or visitor analytics added by the site code.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>The site is served through Cloudflare. Hosting and security infrastructure may process connection information such as IP addresses and request details to deliver and protect the site. This is not a promise that no data is processed.</p><h2>Previous StocksWatch services</h2><p>The former NBIS newsletter and payment services are not connected to this site's new content. Removing their forms from the website does not delete an existing subscription, purchase record or third-party account. Existing newsletter subscribers can use the unsubscribe option in their newsletter emails.</p><h2>Links and recommendations</h2><p>Other websites apply their own privacy terms when you visit them. This version has no affiliate links or sponsored placements. If that changes, the relationship will be disclosed where the recommendation appears.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>This page will be updated if the site introduces a feature that changes its data handling.</p></article></Layout>
